q('Recall the main data anchors for women’s work, health, representation and education, with their sources.','PLFS 2025: female LFPR 40.0%, male 79.1%; women’s earnings 76% of men’s|2024 domestic work: 289 vs 88 minutes; Lok Sabha 74/543|NFHS-5: women’s anaemia 57%; SRS 2022–24 MMR 87|NFHS-6: institutional births 90.6%, early marriage 20.1%|AISHE 2023–24 higher education: 49.7% women','synthesis',scope='chapter',note='Integrated context reconstruction; exact-value practice is provided in Data Drill.')
