q('Trace the changing logic of women’s collective action from reform to intersectionality.','Social reform: education, sati, widow remarriage|Nationalism: political/labour participation → equality/vote|Grassroots: forests, livelihoods, rape and dowry|Feminist waves: rights → reproductive justice → intersectionality → online harassment|Organisations: informal work, credit, Dalit rights and global standards','synthesis',scope='chapter')
