q('Reproduce the chapter’s main population-change reasoning chain.','Births − deaths + net migration → population change|Falling deaths before births → expansion|Later fertility decline → slower growth/ageing|Age structure + human capital + employment → dividend potential|Policy shifts from birth limits toward choice/family care','synthesis',scope='chapter')
